The following script found that 4k blocks wrote max data (I believe):

(generate infinate data) | dd ibs=4k obs=4k of=/dev/rmt0l

dd bs=4k if=/dev/rmt0l of=/dev/null does indeed read 2Gb

2) The serious problems occur when real work needs to be done:

