Regarding my earlier message that Xterm and DECterm clients started
from our Alpha system failed with "no available pty's" -- the solution,
pointed out to me by a respondent (thanks again!) was that the
xterm and dxterm binaries were owned by bin vs. root.  Since they
are setuid programs, clearly the ownership must be correct, and
ownership by other than root prevents allocation of pty's in this case.

The solution was setting the ownerships to root.  All is working again.
