to be written and a verify the tape contents and get back only about <<500Mb

I.E.

Write tape:

find . -print|egrep -v '^proc|tmp/'|cpio -ocv|compress|dd bs=4k of=/dev/rmt0l

Verify tape:

dd bs=4k if=/dev/rmt0l|uncompress|cpio -ict

Any ideas??  Is v2.0 buggy in the areas of dd or mt driver??   

Additionally: is v2.0 buggy on NFS client side of heavy loads.  If I try
to back up other systems that are NFS mounted, my box panics??

