    Free space:             12366 pages ( 75%)


Total swap allocation:
    Allocated space:        36331 pages (283MB)
    Reserved space:         10889 pages ( 29%)
    In-use space:            8146 pages ( 22%)
    Available space:        25442 pages ( 70%)
koibito.iisc.com>


I really recommend the "System Tuning and Performance Management" booklet
This is also in the online docs in ../BOOKREADER/system.decw_bookshelf

