On most of Unix systems the command (shell script) named "xon" can be used
for this purpose:
This command is provided with X11 distrib

on DEC OSF/1 -->   /usr/bin/X11/xon

#!/bin/sh
# 
# *****************************************************************
# *                                                               *
# *    Copyright (c) Digital Equipment Corporation, 1991, 1994    *
# *                                                               *
# *   All Rights Reserved.  Unpublished rights  reserved  under   *
# *   the copyright laws of the United States.                    *
