Try:

modem:23:respawn:/usr/lib/uucp/uugetty -t 30 ttyd0 9600 vt100

or

modem:23:respawn:/usr/sbin/getty ttyd0 M9600 vt100

Note that the uugetty entry has "vt100" and the getty entry does 
not have "-t 30".

